.TH "LX-MUSIC-SOURCES" "1" "2026" "" "LX-Music-Shell Sources Manual"
.SH NAME
lx-music-sources \- manage LX-Music-Shell music source configurations
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B lx-music-sources
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B lx-music-sources
is a utility for managing LX-Music-Shell music source configurations.
It can discover, test, update, and import music source APIs from various
Chinese music platforms including Kugou, Kuwo, QQ Music, NetEase Cloud Music,
MiGu, and Ximalaya.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-update
Discover and update all music source URLs from network
.TP
.B \-\-test
Test connectivity of all configured sources
.TP
.B \-\-list
List currently configured sources
.TP
.B \-\-import \fIFILE\fR
Import source configuration from FILE
.TP
.B \-\-export \fIFILE\fR
Export current source configuration to FILE
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help message
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
Show version information
.SH CONFIGURATION
.TP
Sources file: \fI~/.config/lx-music-shell/sources.list\fR
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Update all sources:
.B lx-music-sources --update
.TP
Test all sources:
.B lx-music-sources --test
.TP
Import sources from file:
.B lx-music-sources --import my-sources.list
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR lx-music-shell (1)
